### IntelliJ HTTP Client 요청 모음 (docs/API.md 기준)
### 사용법: 우측 상단 환경을 'local'로 선택 → 요청 옆 ▶ 클릭
### 회원가입 또는 로그인을 먼저 실행하면 jwt 변수가 자동 저장됩니다.
### email, password는 http/http-client.env.json 의 local 환경 값을 씁니다.

### 0. 서버 동작 확인
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hello

### 1-1. 회원가입 (이미 가입했으면 409 → 1-2 로그인)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "nickname": "음악덕후"
}

> {%
    if (response.status === 201) {
        client.global.set("jwt", response.body.accessToken);
        client.global.set("myId", response.body.user.id);
    }
%}

### 1-2. 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("jwt", response.body.accessToken);
    client.global.set("myId", response.body.user.id);
%}

### 2. 내 정보
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 3. 내 정보 수정 (보낸 필드만)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "바뀐닉네임"
}

### 3-1. 비밀번호 변경
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "{{password}}",
  "newPassword": "{{password}}"
}

### S-1. Spotify 검색 (서버에 SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID/SECRET 필요, 없으면 503)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/spotify/search?q=아이유&type=track&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### S-2. Spotify 곡 정보
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/spotify/tracks/4uLU6hMCjMI75M1A2tKUQC
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### S-3. Spotify 플리 정보 + 수록곡
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/spotify/playlists/3cEYpjA9oz9GiPac4AsH4n
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 4-1. 리뷰 작성 (곡)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "TRACK",
  "spotifyId": "4uLU6hMCjMI75M1A2tKUQC",
  "item": {
    "name": "Never Gonna Give You Up",
    "subtitle": "Rick Astley",
    "imageUrl": "https://i.scdn.co/image/ab67616d0000b27315ebbedaacef61af244262a8"
  },
  "rating": 4.5,
  "comment": "몇 번을 들어도 좋다",
  "tags": ["신나는", "80년대"]
}

> {% client.global.set("reviewId", response.body.id); %}

### 4-2. 리뷰 작성 (플레이리스트)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "PLAYLIST",
  "spotifyId": "3cEYpjA9oz9GiPac4AsH4n",
  "item": {
    "name": "새벽 드라이브",
    "subtitle": "smedjan",
    "imageUrl": "https://i.scdn.co/image/ab67706c0000da84"
  },
  "rating": 4.5,
  "conceptScore": 5.0,
  "flowScore": 4.5,
  "discoveryScore": 3.5,
  "snapshotId": "MTY4NjY2OTQ0MCwwMDAwMDAwMA==",
  "ownerSpotifyId": "smedjan",
  "comment": "곡 순서가 자연스럽다",
  "tags": ["드라이브"]
}

### 4-3. 검증 실패 예시 (곡 리뷰에 플리 필드) → 400 INVALID_REVIEW_FIELDS
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "TRACK",
  "spotifyId": "11dFghVXANMlKmJXsNCbNl",
  "item": { "name": "Cut To The Feeling" },
  "rating": 4.0,
  "flowScore": 3.0
}

### 5. 리뷰 단건 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 6. 리뷰 수정
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5.0,
  "tags": ["명곡"]
}

### 7. 리뷰 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 8. 항목의 리뷰 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/track/4uLU6hMCjMI75M1A2tKUQC/reviews?page=0&size=20&sort=latest
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 9. 항목 요약
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/playlist/3cEYpjA9oz9GiPac4AsH4n/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 10. 최신 피드
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feed?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 11. 인기 항목
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feed/popular?days=7&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 12. 유저의 리뷰 + 통계 (4.5점 이상 곡만)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{myId}}/reviews?type=TRACK&minRating=4.5
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 13. 내 리뷰 일괄 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/mine?type=TRACK&spotifyIds=4uLU6hMCjMI75M1A2tKUQC,11dFghVXANMlKmJXsNCbNl
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 14. 큐레이터 랭킹
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/curators/ranking?minReviews=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
